---
---

<section id="how-it-helps" class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-4">How Does Essential Tech Help?</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-primary font-medium">Pay only for what You need When You need iT</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Image -->
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1">
        <img src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/002-video-conference.png" alt="Video Conference" class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto" />
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 space-y-6">
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">
          Lets face it as a small business owner you probably have better things to worry about than the tech that you need to run your business.&nbsp; Honestly you probably only care about two things: Is it Effectively being used&nbsp;and is it Efficiently being delivered.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-blue-100">
          <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium">
             There is nothing worse in your mind than paying too much for tech when all you really need are the Essentials .&nbsp; &nbsp; Thats why we think our Essential Tech Support Service is the perfect fit for small businesses just like yours.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
           We cover the essentials you need at an affordable monthly rate and provide you with the support you need when you need it.
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-4">
          {["SECURITY", "BACKUP", "SUPPORT"].map((tag) => (
            <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 rounded-full text-sm font-bold tracking-wider hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default">
              {tag}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
